{"turn_id": "d05-t1", "session_id": "d05", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "f1_metric", "text": "端到端查询生成的评估指标为平均 F1 分数（average F1-scores）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "precision_recall", "text": "分析中报告了 precision 与 recall，例如增加训练数据时，基于查询子结构的方法在 precision 和 recall 上均获得稳定提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "topk_metric", "text": "评估中使用 top-1 与 top-5 输出中正确生成查询的比例作为指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "datasets", "text": "实验在两个基准数据集上进行：LC-QuAD（3,253 个问题）和 QALD-5（311 个问题）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-05d777500a51e5fb8c20b32b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d05-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d05-t2", "session_id": "d05", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "datasets", "text": "实验使用两个数据集：LC-QuAD（含3,253个问题，在DBpedia 2016-04上有非空结果）和QALD-5（含311个问题，在DBpedia 2015-10上有非空结果）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-05d777500a51e5fb8c20b32b"}]}, {"key": "cross_validation", "text": "每个数据集采用5折交叉验证，训练集70%、开发集10%、测试集20%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-05d777500a51e5fb8c20b32b"}]}, {"key": "metric_f1", "text": "端到端查询生成任务的评估指标是平均F1分数（average F1-scores），结果报告在Table TABREF35中，且均以gold标准实体/关系链接结果作为输入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "outperforms_baselines", "text": "在LC-QuAD与QALD-5两个数据集上，SubQG均优于所有对比方法（SINA、NLIWOD、SQG、CompQA），且相较CompQA在复杂问题上取得了更显著的提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "qald5_lower", "text": "QALD-5上的结果不如LC-QuAD高，原因是QALD-5包含11%的非常困难问题（需要Regex、数值比较等复杂过滤条件），超出该方法能力，同时训练数据规模显著更小。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-c81b2f5db39faa2220e61c0b"}]}, {"key": "top1_top5_noisy_linking", "text": "在将每个mention的正确链接结果与EARL生成的top-5候选混合的噪声设定下，首个输出的precision下降11.4%，但在85%的情况下仍能在top-5中生成正确答案。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "top1_top5_earl_only", "text": "仅使用EARL链接结果时性能大幅下降，原因是82.8%的问题上EARL只给出部分正确结果；若只看剩余问题，top-1和top-5输出中正确生成查询的比例分别为73.2%和84.8%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "precision_recall_vs_training", "text": "在LC-QuAD上测试不同训练数据规模：随着训练数据增加，基于查询子结构的方法在precision和recall上均获得稳定提升；合并模块（merging）会略微损害整体precision，但对recall提升更大，尤其在训练数据很少时。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "substructure_ablation", "text": "按Table TABREF39的结果，完整版SubQG在两个数据集上均取得最佳结果；去掉子结构的Rank w/o substructures性能相对较低，尤其在训练数据不足时（QALD-5上）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-888ad445b4684a4dd148f450"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d05-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
